Hi everyone,

NetHacked is a simple new project that aims to serve as home for the
best-available or "gold standard" version of vanilla NetHack.

The idea is for NetHacked to act as the focal point for all current
and future bugfixes and interface enhancement patches, incorporating
these and providing source and binary downloads.  There are no plans
to change game behavior.

If you are interested, please visit http://nethacked.github.com/ for
more information and a README file with additional details.  I invite
your suggestions and/or contributions.

